abricated current level. `backup_age_seconds` is nullable trusted observation, not an `/admin/backup` completion signal. | Unknown future overview shapes must be treated as incompatible by strict console readers. Missing or untrusted `source`, stale leaders during elections, omitted unreachable members, or `backup_age_seconds:0` for never-backed-up namespaces must fail tests or degrade honestly before the console trusts the view. |\n| Server HydraCache actuator mount | `1` | `hydracache-server` `/actuator/hydracache/*` | `0.57.0` mounts the existing read-only `hydracache-actuator-axum` JSON routes on the internal admin listener. The daemon registers its cache as `server`; `/actuator/hydracache/health`, `/caches`, `/caches/server/diagnostics`, `/caches/server/stats`, `/cluster/staging-health`, `/cluster/pilot-report`, and `/correctness` are granular diagnostics that complement `/cluster/overview`. | The mount must remain read-only, available during drain, and absent from the public client surface. Unknown cache names return `404`; missing admin mount or accidental client-port exposure fails server actuator mount tests. |\n| Simulator snapshot JSON schema | `5` | `hydracache-sim` and `hydracache-sim-wasm` | Readers accept the current schema only and reject unknown future versions. Version `1` carried seed, step, logical time, nodes, links, sampled keys, real invariant verdict, and progress. Version `2` adds the 0.53 W1 election/formation fields: `formation_phase`, `election_source`, `election_disclosure`, and per-node `vote_state`, `voted_for`, `votes_received`. Version `3` adds typed `in_flight` network/election messages plus `over_budget.in_flight_summarized` for bounded rendering. Version `4` adds manual-mode `clients`, `subscribers`, and `sync_progress`. Version `5` adds topology/mode state: per-node `disabled`, top-level `rebalance`, `mode`, `active_scenario`, and `intervention_count`. | Strict readers reject unknown future schema versions before rendering or rep